This licence covers the COMPILATION — the selection, arrangement and
presentation of the data in this repository.

It does not, and cannot, license the underlying job listings. Those are public
statements made by the companies posting them, and each row links to the
employer's own page. Titles, company names and locations are facts.

You are free to share and adapt this dataset, for any purpose including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit to Lynceus and link back to
https://trylynceus.com.

